# P1.3 bundle (0): computed_namespace BODY recursion (data-loss regression)
#
# Locks the walker event shape for `namespace eval $var BODY` containing a
# nested literal proc. The bridge driver's _dispatch_event now follows this
# event with body recursion (kind=computed_namespace branch) so the inner
# proc is no longer silently dropped. This fixture validates that the walker
# emits the computed_namespace event the bridge driver depends on; the
# end-to-end recursion verdict lives in the pytest suite
# (TestComputedNamespaceBodyRecursion).
namespace eval ::Outer {
    proc literal_proc {} { puts hello }
    set ns_dyn ::Dynamic
    namespace eval $ns_dyn { proc dropped_proc {} { puts world } }
}

